# CR 608.2b: the reflexive ability's only target, Bot2's Llanowar Elves, is killed in response to it (Bot2 Lightning Bolts its
# own Elves with a Mox Ruby kept untapped; the checks show the Faeries exist and the Elves are alive while the ability is the one item on the stack), so the ability is countered on resolution and does nothing; the Faeries,
# created by the spell, are unaffected and untapped.

